24:["$","section",null,{"id":"coping","aria-labelledby":"coping-heading","className":"scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line pt-12","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-brand","children":"Coping strategies"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"coping-heading","className":"mt-3 max-w-2xl font-serif text-3xl leading-tight text-ink","children":"Evidence-based tools you can try today"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-prose text-base leading-relaxed text-body","children":"Each of these is drawn from an established therapy protocol. Start with one and repeat it — a tool used badly twice beats a tool read about once."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","li","Delay and reduce",{"className":"flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-serif text-2xl text-brand","children":"01"}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-serif text-xl leading-snug text-ink","children":"Delay and reduce"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":"A gentle entry point to response prevention when full ERP feels impossible."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-line pt-5","children":[["$","li","When the urge arrives, set a timer for ten minutes.",{"className":"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"}],"When the urge arrives, set a timer for ten minutes."]}],["$","li","Notice the anxiety rise and then fall without the ritual.",{"className":"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"}],"Notice the anxiety rise and then fall without the ritual."]}],["$","li","If you still perform it, reduce it — check once, not six times.",{"clas